e prepared for buying a  house negotiating a salary client  interactions negotiating rent or  deliberating with your partner this is a  great book with direct applications to  day-to-day interactions with other  people including your family it helps  you sit through conflicts and tensions  and figure out better solutions that  result in better outcomes for you  in the end this is a book about not just  being good at negotiation but being  great in life never spread the  difference is deep wisdom conveyed with  great humor storytelling and insight  read it to be a more effective human  next on our list is the science of  storytelling by will storm stories are  what makes us human and in this book  will star talks about the themes and  characteristics that we need to use to  become better storytellers storytelling  is an integral part of human survival  and understanding how to put up a story  to trigger emotional elements of mind to  keep a viewer intrigued is what this  book digs deep into the book is divided  into four chapters designed to look at  the story through its various levels the  chapters are one creating a world  two the flawed self three the dramatic  questions and four plots endings and  meanings  though writers and would-be writers are  a primary audience for this book its  appeal is wider than that  somewhat profoundly it throws new light  on the story of our own lives as well so  if you are interested in learning the  art of storytelling we highly recommend  this book because it's written in a  concise and inspiring way and it  provides a lot of value at the fourth  spot we have the book to help you  improve your finances the psychology of  money by morgan hauser what's the best  way to manage your money that's a  question that everyone has an answer for  but the right question is what's the  best way for you and in comes the book  the psychology of money most books when  they analyze investment or financial  management focus solely on the technical  part of it but this book focuses on the  human psychology element of investing  and building up wealth over time through  the lens of history and personal tales  the author teaches us the most profound  insights on the psychology of money but  it means to us how we spend and save and  invest how we connect who we are today  and who we might be tomorrow morgan  teaches you how to have a better  relationship with money and to make  smarter financial decisions on top of it  all the book is a quick read with the  big payoff the last one on our list is  one of ray dalio's masterpieces  principles if you are a person  struggling with decision making this  book is for you you might have come  across many leadership and development  books but this book would hit you  differently with its practical resources  and mostly good narration this book lets  you take away of important principles  for your life like systemizing your  decision making being radically  open-minded how to handle your  weaknesses a five-step process to  ultimate success and learning how to  synthesize well through this book ray  dalio explains how to solve a problem to  get a token he calls principle which  enables him not to repeat the same  mistake again as said by ray dalio the  author principles are fundamental truths  that serve as the foundations for  behavior that get you what you want out  of life this book should go to your must  read list if you want to be a successful  entrepreneur or if you are a striving  employee who's dreaming of reaching  greater heights or even anyone who'd  like to learn and adapt new principles  in their life for a better future that  brings us to the end of the video thanks  for watching we hope you enjoyed this  video please comment down below the name  of the book you want to read first we  want to know and stay tuned for more  from simply learn  [Music]  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel and click here to watch similar